cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper listed under preferred-citation."
title: "brainGL web"
type: software
abstract: >-
  brainGL web is a browser port of the connectivity-glyph visualization of brainGL. brainGL was written by Ralph
  Schurade; the connexel, glyph and edge-bundling code is by Joachim Böttger; the Directionality workspace is a
  vendored copy of directionality-indicator-webgl, a port of DirectionalityIndicator by Sebastian Eichelbaum. The
  refactoring of the software for the web browser was done by Daniel S. Margulies using Claude.
authors:
